#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/postlfs/shells/shells.xml:14
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"We are all familiar with the Bourne Again SHell, but there are two other "
"user interfaces that are considered useful modern shells &ndash; the "
"Berkeley Unix C shell and the Korn shell.  This chapter installs packages "
"compatible with these additional shell types."
msgstr ""
